@startuml complete-google-account-link
title Confirm a link with an existing CRM account
hide footbox

actor User
participant "CRM client" as Client
participant "ASP.NET bearer auth" as Auth
participant CompleteGoogleAccountLinkController as Controller
participant CompleteGoogleAccountLinkHandler as Handler
database "SQL Server" as Database

note over User,Client: The user has authenticated to CRM after linkRequired
User -> Client: Confirm linking
Client -> Auth: POST /api/auth/google/link\nCRM bearer token and {continuationToken}
break Missing or invalid CRM access token
    Auth --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
end
Auth -> Controller: Authenticated principal
Controller -> Controller: Read CRM account GUID from JWT sub
break Missing or invalid CRM account GUID
    Controller --> Client: 401 Unauthorized
end
Controller -> Handler: Send CompleteGoogleAccountLinkCommand\nwith account ID and token via MediatR
Handler -> Handler: Hash the continuation token and read UTC time
Handler -> Database: Begin transaction\nRead active continuation by hash, account ID and expiry
break No matching unexpired continuation
    Handler -> Database: Transaction rolls back
    Controller --> Client: 401 Auth.InvalidGoogleLinkContinuation
end
Handler -> Database: Check CRM account's current email and status
break Email mismatch or inactive account
    Handler -> Database: Transaction rolls back
    Controller --> Client: 401 invalid continuation or 403 inactive account
end
Handler -> Database: ExecuteDeleteAsync by token hash
Database --> Handler: Affected row count
break Another request consumed the continuation
    Handler -> Database: Transaction rolls back
    Controller --> Client: 401 Auth.InvalidGoogleLinkContinuation
end
Handler -> Database: SaveChangesAsync with GoogleSubject and AccountId
break Unique constraint conflict on Google subject or CRM account
    Handler -> Database: Transaction rolls back
    Controller --> Client: 409 Auth.GoogleAccountLinkConflict
end
Handler -> Database: Commit account link and continuation deletion
Handler --> Controller: Command completed
Controller --> Client: 204 No Content
@enduml
